.TH SDL_GetSurfaceAlphaMod 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetSurfaceAlphaMod \- Get the additional alpha value used in blit operations.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_surface.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_GetSurfaceAlphaMod(SDL_Surface *surface, Uint8 *alpha);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I surface
the
.BR SDL_Surface
structure to query\[char46]
.TP
.I alpha
a pointer filled in with the current alpha value\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true on success or false on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

